# W31e, b (k10): stays in stag0201; sees two notices (a's and c's entries), answers c's (dng205b1) and joins c.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until offers>=2 fail epoch>=@1000
log b has two offers
goalong dng205b1 until go=waiting or go=stamped or go=going
log b goes along with c
idle until stage=dng205b1,present=2,sealed>=120 fail epoch>=@1400
log b joined c in dng205b1
idle until offers=0 fail frames>=600
log a's offer closed for b
idle until frames>=1800
